I wrote the step 2 CSV exporter in `widget_export.py`: `export_csv(widgets)` returns the `id,name` header plus one row per widget, and quotes commas, quotes and newlines (the ledger chose CSV and deferred JSON).
The repo had no code or set language yet, so I used Python. If the project uses a different language, the file needs porting.
I didn't run or test it, made no commit, left step 3 and the plan checkbox alone, and wrote nothing to the ledger.
